1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:13,038
Let me give you a quick update
on the WOG Champion League Thailand.

2
00:00:13,039 --> 00:00:17,120
Today, we’ll finally find out
which eight teams make it through.

3
00:00:17,719 --> 00:00:21,079
And more importantly, this is the final stretch

4
00:00:21,239 --> 00:00:27,359
for making it to the Finals.
So between Team GP and Team Somurai,

5
00:00:27,879 --> 00:00:29,960
who are you rooting for?

6
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,880
Tep G.

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,880
Tep G.

8
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,840
What are you spacing out for?

9
00:00:43,841 --> 00:00:44,880
What’s wrong with you?

10
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:46,799
If you’re not okay, just say so.

11
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,399
Nah. I’m fine.

12
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,200
This is really important to me.

13
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:57,840
That’s why I want us to get married for real.

14
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,719
Gaming is like a drug.

15
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,479
It’s ruined a lot of families.

16
00:01:04,159 --> 00:01:07,799
I hate gamers.

17
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:10,840
Ever since P’Phan ran away from home,

18
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:12,760
Dad died.

19
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,000
And it was just Mom and me left.

20
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:31,000
Just one more round.

21
00:01:31,159 --> 00:01:34,079
Then we’re going into the big match.

22
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:37,598
Yeah, just stick to the plan.
If it wins, then it’s the right call.

23
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:39,200
Woo! Amazing!

24
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,560
Kao is Tep G.

25
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:08,719
Tep G...

26
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:16,719
Tep G is the same person Ryan was talking about?

27
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:24,520
Yes.

28
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:29,560
Kao is Tep G
The idol Ryan’s always talking about.

29
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,240
Kao is Tep G?

30
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,198
Kao? You’re Tep G?

31
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:45,240
Come on, are you messing with me?

32
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,000
P’Pee...

33
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,240
Hypothetically...

34
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,919
- if Kao really were Tep G.
- Um

35
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,319
would you be okay with that?

36
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:56,839
Why are you asking me that?

37
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,039
Just answer.

38
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,479
Alright.

39
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,240
Hypothetically...

40
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,879
if.

41
00:03:04,039 --> 00:03:06,199
My partner someone other than Kao the person I loved

42
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:09,560
were a pro player,

43
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,319
someone who played games for a living...

44
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,400
would I be okay with that?

45
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:23,719
No.

46
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,680
What’s with you?

47
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,719
Aren’t you happy? We won.

48
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,759
Yeah, I’m happy.

49
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,719
- That the team made the finals.
- Mm.

50
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,599
But if P’Pee’s like this...

51
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,400
I don’t know what to do.

52
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,158
What are you so stressed about?

53
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:57,039
You’re only married for a year, aren’t you?

54
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:01,960
Yeah.

55
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,439
Yeah, whatever.

56
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:08,479
I think

57
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:10,759
you probably already know
what it is you want.

58
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,200
And what if I don’t?
What if I don’t know what I want?

59
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:16,399
Normally, when it comes to games,

60
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:18,120
you always choose gaming.

61
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:21,839
But now that Mr. Rapee’s in the picture
and you’re hesitating like this.

62
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:24,680
I think you already know what it means.

63
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,439
Ow.

64
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,240
Shit.

65
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,360
Where the hell did that come from?

66
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:48,000
Damn it.

67
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:55,879
Kao.

68
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,959
Kao.

69
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,920
She’s not here.

70
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,319
Uh...

71
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,518
Yes, P’Pee?

72
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,519
Kao.

73
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:18,199
There’s something important I need to talk to you about.

74
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:20,119
Where are you right now?

75
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,519
I’m at school.

76
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:23,239
Working on some paperwork.

77
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,720
What is it, P’Pee?

78
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:27,559
Can you come see me at the basketball court right now?

79
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:32,040
I don’t think I can

80
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,879
I have to hand this in today.

81
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:38,480
Then come see me when you’re done. I’ll wait.

82
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,639
Okay?

83
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,480
Come on, come on.

84
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,480
Last round.

85
00:05:56,481 --> 00:05:57,759
Last one, hurry.

86
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,160
Hey, hey, go!

87
00:05:59,160 --> 00:05:59,720
Go, go!

88
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,560
Hide, hide.

89
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,438
Hey, hey.

90
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,799
We’re close.

91
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,639
So close.

92
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:05,920
Let’s go.

93
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:09,160
Incoming call: Investor Rapee.

94
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,199
Hey, left side

95
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,519
Pete, hurry up. Pete, hurry.

96
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,720
Stay on me, sis, stay on me.

97
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,559
Cover me a little.

98
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,319
Okay, okay.

99
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,359
Okay, okay.

100
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,640
- Yeah, yeah.
- Come on, come on.

101
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:42,278
That’s it. It’s official.

102
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:47,518
- The final team through to the Finals is Team GP.
- Pro League! Pro League.

103
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,439
Pro League! Pro League.

104
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,638
- Where are you going?
- I’ll be back.

105
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:53,319
- Love this team so damn much.
- Pro League! Pro League!

106
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,720
Hey.

107
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:29,959
P’Pee.

108
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,560
You scared me.

109
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:45,519
P’Pee, have you been waiting here the whole time?

110
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:54,240
There’s something I want to talk to you about.

111
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,800
What is it?

112
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,839
And if you can’t say it...

113
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,879
then just take control.

114
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,519
Take control.

115
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:08,000
Take control.

116
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,720
Hey, P’Pee.

117
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,920
What is it? Just tell me.

118
00:08:13,079 --> 00:08:14,439
Are you okay?

119
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,639
It’s just...

120
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,920
I...

121
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,680
It’s just...

122
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,199
Yeah?

123
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:26,000
I like you, Kao.

124
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,360
And.

125
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,199
Do you like me?

126
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,399
What did you get yourself into, P’Pee?

127
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,840
Uh...

128
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,039
Hey.

129
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,559
Hey.

130
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:52,240
I’ll wait and see how you behave first.

131
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:11,720
I’ll make you like me.

132
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:19,200
Because I’m the man who suits you best as a husband.

133
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:54,839
WOG Pro Leaguehas has officially begun.
With an eighteen-million-baht prize pool.

134
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,558
- Woo.
- That’s a lot.

135
00:09:56,559 --> 00:10:00,679
And don’t forget everyone
needs to prepare their slot fee too.

136
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,120
Did you forget?

137
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:04,799
If we’re entering the Pro League,

138
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,440
we need six million just to open a slot.

139
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:09,839
Shit, that’s right

140
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,720
I totally forgot about the slot fee.

141
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:14,176
Where the hell are we gonna get that from?

142
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,519
Six million, man.

143
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:19,480
- Tep G.
- Kao.

144
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,159
Kao.

145
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:26,840
If we’re really doing this,
we need money for the slot too.

146
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,080
Can your husband help at all?

147
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:36,000
Maybe we should try looking for a sponsor first.

148
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:40,480
A sponsor? Feeling confident, huh?

149
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:44,119
Our team’s not even famous
Where are we supposed to get a sponsor from?

150
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,239
So what does that mean?
We’re not competing anymore?

151
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,919
Shit, I’m Tep G, okay?

152
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,120
Hang on a sec.

153
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:53,278
- Hello?
- How did you start a team with no funding?

154
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:55,960
- Oh, yes. Team GP.
- Just put yourself on the line, sis.

155
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,360
Guys.

156
00:10:58,919 --> 00:11:00,000
Guys!

157
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:01,159
What?

158
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:03,600
Momon-chan called.

159
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:04,879
Doraemon?

160
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,039
Momon-chan, asshole.

161
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,680
You little shit keep that up
and you’re getting slapped.

162
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,519
Momon-chan?

163
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:12,039
Hello? Wait, what?

164
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:16,000
Oh, okay.

165
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:34,200
- Oh.
- Mm.

166
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,440
Mm.

167
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:55,159
I’m Momon-chan. Nice to meet you.

168
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:57,799
You’re Tep G, right?

169
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,120
I’ve been looking for you for a long time.

170
00:12:02,639 --> 00:12:03,840
Our company

171
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:06,320
has always managed top athletes.

172
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:09,200
But now we’re opening a new division

173
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:12,240
esports.

174
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:16,360
And I see real potential in Team GP.

175
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,440
I want to manage your team myself.

176
00:12:19,879 --> 00:12:21,080
We’ll hire a coach.

177
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,960
A strategy analyst.

178
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,240
To put it simply,

179
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:27,639
I’ll take care of the team for you.

180
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:31,440
When you say ‘take care of us does
that include the slot fee?

181
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,600
Of course.

182
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,480
And what do you get out of it?

183
00:12:34,679 --> 00:12:38,000
We’ll deduct an operating fee. After expenses.

184
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:42,480
I’ll take thirty percent of your prize money.

185
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:44,440
That’s steep.

186
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:47,279
Okay. Thirty it is.

187
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:51,159
And the rights to manage the team
do they still stay with me?

188
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:53,440
We won’t interfere too much.

189
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:56,840
After all, this is the team
you built with your own hands.

190
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,000
But for anything important

191
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:01,360
we’ll discuss it first.

192
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:05,440
I always put the team’s best interest first.

193
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:09,000
If we agree, when do we start?

194
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,639
Starting tomorrow.

195
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:14,559
I’ll arrange a place for your training camp.

196
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:17,720
And starting tomorrow,
we begin a professional training plan.

197
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:19,279
Okay.

198
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:22,079
But in two or three days,
I’ve got something I need to do

199
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:25,559
I might be hard to reach
Will that be a problem?

200
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:40,080
What kind of rice did you use?

201
00:13:40,919 --> 00:13:43,639
I told you
I want Mother’s Day jasmine rice, not this.

202
00:13:44,039 --> 00:13:45,798
Mother’s Day jasmine rice.

203
00:13:45,799 --> 00:13:47,159
Go buy a new bag too.

204
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:48,519
P’Pee.

205
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,000
Kao thinks this chandelier looks really nice.

206
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:56,119
If we add more like this
in different spots here, and here

207
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,559
I think it’d look good.

208
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,519
Yeah.

209
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,279
I agree. I think it looks nice too.

210
00:14:05,879 --> 00:14:07,519
Hey, Kao.

211
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:11,038
The team’s already sent over the tour plan

212
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,359
for the customer package we’re putting together.

213
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,600
- Here, take a look.
- Mm.

214
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,919
Whoa.

215
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,320
So?

216
00:14:20,679 --> 00:14:22,440
Looks good, right?

217
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,480
If it’s good, then we’re screwed.

218
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,535
How about this. Kao thinks it’d be better

219
00:14:26,559 --> 00:14:28,759
if Kao just takes you to see the real place.

220
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:34,519
Kao... then how are we getting there?
Should I drive?

221
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:39,080
This is Uncle Samruay.

222
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:45,159
He’ll be our driver for this trip.

223
00:15:17,039 --> 00:15:19,279
- Here.
- Please take care of us.

224
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,200
Hey.

225
00:15:22,759 --> 00:15:24,039
Come on, let’s play.

226
00:15:24,519 --> 00:15:26,480
Drop dead.

227
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,679
Ow, ow easy, Kao. Easy.

228
00:15:30,879 --> 00:15:32,080
Hey.

229
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:34,159
Kao, watch it.

230
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:40,279
This is what the locals grow around here.

231
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,000
- Please take care of us.
- Please.

232
00:15:44,519 --> 00:15:45,559
What?

233
00:16:26,919 --> 00:16:28,440
Sweet.

234
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,840
Come to think of it

235
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:49,200
your hotel’s really beautiful too, P’Pee.

236
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,679
The atmosphere’s great too.

237
00:16:52,159 --> 00:16:54,000
It used to be even prettier.

238
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:05,400
P’Pee...

239
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,000
What’s in the past

240
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:11,279
should stay in the past.

241
00:17:13,799 --> 00:17:15,880
Let’s make new memories instead.

242
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,720
Better ones.

243
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:23,240
Make new ones?

244
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,400
Mm.

245
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:30,359
With the hotel... and other things too.

246
00:17:31,519 --> 00:17:35,079
You can’t change the past.

247
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,079
But you can create something new, right?

248
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:12,880
What mood is this?

249
00:18:13,079 --> 00:18:15,319
Want to grill some pork? You hungry?

250
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:18,160
I’m not. But I figured.

251
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:20,839
Kao might be. Want some?

252
00:18:21,799 --> 00:18:24,920
No. My hair’ll smelll just washed it.

253
00:18:25,559 --> 00:18:26,559
Come here.

254
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,118
- Come eat.
- Hey.

255
00:18:28,119 --> 00:18:30,519
- I’ll wash it for you.
- No, no. I’m too lazy.

256
00:18:30,759 --> 00:18:31,798
P’Pee.

257
00:18:31,799 --> 00:18:34,359
Sit down, sit down. I’ll wash it for you.

258
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:39,599
- Hot and fresh.
- Please enjoy.

259
00:18:52,599 --> 00:18:53,799
This place is really good.

260
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,359
- Really? Then here.
- Mm.

261
00:18:55,519 --> 00:18:56,519
You like that one, right?

262
00:18:58,279 --> 00:18:59,279
Here.

263
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,559
Do you like it, Kao?

264
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,920
Mm.

265
00:19:50,759 --> 00:19:52,079
What are you smiling at?

266
00:19:54,319 --> 00:19:56,880
I think maybe the two of us

267
00:19:58,319 --> 00:20:00,480
really are kind of like husband and wife.

268
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,519
Mm.

269
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,038
- Mm.
- Hm.

270
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:32,960
- Mm.
- That’s enough.

271
00:20:33,359 --> 00:20:34,839
Like husband and wife.

272
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:36,559
Enough.

273
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:15,119
We have to get back to the lights.

274
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,799
Three minutes left.

275
00:22:35,359 --> 00:22:36,359
And...

276
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,160
where did Tep G go?

277
00:22:38,480 --> 00:22:41,400
So it’s just us getting worn out over this stuff?

278
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:45,480
Is Kao with her boyfriend?

279
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:48,519
That’s kind of nasty.

280
00:22:49,559 --> 00:22:51,719
You’re making it sound like P’Kao’s ditching practice.

281
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,319
But... yeah.

282
00:22:53,599 --> 00:22:55,000
She is with her boyfriend.

283
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:03,359
Shit, I almost forgot.

284
00:23:03,559 --> 00:23:04,839
Forgot what, Kao?

285
00:23:06,039 --> 00:23:07,759
Uh, it’s just...

286
00:23:08,079 --> 00:23:10,799
- It’s just Kao...
- Then how about this today,

287
00:23:11,319 --> 00:23:12,839
let’s go to the market instead.

288
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,959
I’ve already lined up some good places.

289
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,640
So we can wrap this project up. Okay?

290
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,160
Sounds good.

291
00:23:19,559 --> 00:23:22,400
But P’Pee, Kao might have to head back today.

292
00:23:22,839 --> 00:23:24,758
Kao just remembered.

293
00:23:24,759 --> 00:23:27,079
Kao has to go survey the camp at school.

294
00:23:27,799 --> 00:23:29,039
Oh?

295
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:32,000
Then why didn’t you tell me earlier?

296
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,518
I forgot.

297
00:23:33,519 --> 00:23:35,358
Then how about this. we’ll eat first,

298
00:23:35,359 --> 00:23:37,440
and then I’ll call a car to pick you up.

299
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,799
Take it easy. Kao’s not in that much of a hurry.

300
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,640
Fine, have it your way.

301
00:23:42,359 --> 00:23:43,799
But the day after tomorrow

302
00:23:44,599 --> 00:23:46,559
there’s an important Double P event.

303
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:49,599
I want Kao to come with me.

304
00:23:49,759 --> 00:23:50,960
No ditching, okay?

305
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,440
Okay.

306
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:56,559
Kao won’t ditch. Promise.

307
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:58,079
Promise?

308
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:09,240
Here it comes.

309
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,799
Here it comes, everyone.

310
00:24:15,599 --> 00:24:17,118
Wait till they bunch up first.

311
00:24:17,119 --> 00:24:18,279
Don’t rush in yet.

312
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:19,920
Take it slow.

313
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:22,479
Shit, grenade.

314
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,960
Oh, bye-bye.

315
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:25,759
What the hell are you doing?

316
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:27,838
Shoot them, damn it
If you see them, shoot.

317
00:24:27,839 --> 00:24:29,519
- Yeah, yeah, I’m shooting.
- Yeah, yeah.

318
00:24:30,039 --> 00:24:31,758
Oh, shit.

319
00:24:31,759 --> 00:24:33,399
Let me put this on record

320
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,078
everyone’s response time

321
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:37,160
when a teammate gets attacked is way too slow.

322
00:24:39,559 --> 00:24:42,479
You shooting my teammate?

323
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,399
Eat this frying pan.

324
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,919
Damn, Kao.

325
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:48,079
If you’d come sooner, I wouldn’t have died.

326
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,879
If I came out too soon, I wouldn’t look cool.

327
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:50,880
Woo.

328
00:24:54,319 --> 00:24:56,559
One, two, three.

329
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:59,039
Ooh, nice. Try it first.

330
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:00,200
Look.

331
00:25:01,039 --> 00:25:02,759
Damn.

332
00:25:03,279 --> 00:25:05,200
Shit, that looks so fake.

333
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:07,479
P’Pee’s not dumb. He won’t believe it.

334
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:09,759
Just send it already. Trust me.

335
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:12,359
- Really?
- Just send it. Yeah, send it.

336
00:25:14,079 --> 00:25:15,720
Fine, I’ll try.

337
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:28,039
Hello, P’Pee.

338
00:25:28,200 --> 00:25:29,640
Wish you were here with us.

339
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:35,599
Kao wishes P’Pee were here too.

340
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,640
Where are you, P’Pee?

341
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:40,399
I’m getting ready for the hotel anniversary event.

342
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:43,559
Speaking of the hotel,
don’t forget you promised to come with me.

343
00:25:44,599 --> 00:25:46,119
Kao didn’t forget, P’Pee.

344
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:51,439
P’Pee, I’ve gotta go now.

345
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:54,880
The auntie next to me keeps glaring
I think she doesn’t want me on the phone.

346
00:26:07,759 --> 00:26:09,640
Am I playing a game or what?

347
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,960
Didn’t you say

348
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,719
you’d stick to the plan we agreed on?

349
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:24,079
If we stick to the plan, we lose, Coach.

350
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,400
Pete.

351
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:32,880
Stop eating.

352
00:26:33,039 --> 00:26:34,039
Go practice.

353
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,239
It’s almost time.

354
00:26:39,240 --> 00:26:41,838
Everyone, get ready
We’re starting practice.

355
00:26:41,839 --> 00:26:44,359
P’Pee, Kao’s heading out first
Kao has to go help Mom with work.

356
00:26:44,599 --> 00:26:48,358
- Yeah, okay. See you later then.
- Where did Noppakao go?

357
00:26:48,359 --> 00:26:50,879
Kao, Kao the coach is here.

358
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,880
Yeah.

359
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:54,920
Crackle, crackle... P’Pee
Crackle, crackle... hello?

360
00:26:55,079 --> 00:26:56,479
The signal’s really bad, P’Pee.

361
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:58,319
Uh... Kao’s up in the mountains right now.

362
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:02,480
Uh... I mean, we’re on the mountain
The car’s driving downhill.

363
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:05,240
Don’t worry, P’Pee
Kao will make it for sure.

364
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:06,599
Okay, bye.

365
00:27:08,839 --> 00:27:09,839
Guys.

366
00:27:10,519 --> 00:27:12,039
I’ll hurry back.

367
00:27:12,559 --> 00:27:14,720
Hey, hey you’ve got practice tomorrow.

368
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:15,999
Don’t forget.

369
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,440
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

370
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:28,079
Rawr.

371
00:27:32,359 --> 00:27:34,240
What’s wrong with you? Go get dressed.

372
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:38,119
This way.

373
00:28:13,079 --> 00:28:15,359
(For my wife)

374
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,119
P’Pee...

375
00:29:05,519 --> 00:29:07,879
You were about to look pretty,
that’s enough, that’s enough.

376
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:11,880
Let’s go. Woo.

377
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:13,920
- Wait, wait, wait. Not yet.
- Hm?

378
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,680
P’Pee saw that Kao forgot...

379
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:20,119
this in the room.

380
00:29:21,559 --> 00:29:23,039
Uh...

381
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:28,839
P’Pee wants to ask Kao

382
00:29:30,319 --> 00:29:34,200
to come to this event as P’Pee’s wife.

383
00:29:35,119 --> 00:29:36,400
Please.

384
00:29:48,279 --> 00:29:49,279
Go.

385
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:57,519
- Let’s go. Woo.
- Woo.

386
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:04,279
- I’m hungry.
- Wanna eat after this?

387
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:10,160
Damn, Professor, all dressed up like that
where are you off to?

388
00:30:10,319 --> 00:30:15,160
Oh, I’m going to
Double P Hotel’s 20th anniversary party.

389
00:30:15,319 --> 00:30:17,160
So I figured I’d dress up a bit.

390
00:30:19,759 --> 00:30:23,319
I happen to have a friend
who owns a hotel business.

391
00:30:23,599 --> 00:30:25,519
The Double P hotel chain.

392
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:26,758
Know it?

393
00:30:26,759 --> 00:30:28,079
Can’t tell you.

394
00:30:28,279 --> 00:30:29,920
That guy hates games.

395
00:30:36,960 --> 00:30:39,440
Can anyone hear me? Let me out.

396
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,480
Sorry, Professor.

397
00:30:45,559 --> 00:30:47,400
You hungry? Want to grab something to eat?

398
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:49,759
- Mm. Buy something for Professor too.
- Come on.

399
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,960
- Yeah Come on, help me out.
- Mm.

400
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:52,920
Ow.

401
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,920
- Want noodles?
- Yeah.

402
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:13,039
Hey, hey. Look at this. Look at the cabinet.

403
00:31:15,359 --> 00:31:16,240
Look.

404
00:31:16,241 --> 00:31:18,400
Hey, open it for me.

405
00:31:20,119 --> 00:31:21,359
- Professor.
- Professor.

406
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:37,880
Thanks.

407
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:45,880
- I’m full. Now I’m sleepy.
- Yeah.

408
00:31:46,119 --> 00:31:47,758
This place is pretty good, actually.

409
00:31:47,759 --> 00:31:49,000
Good enough.

410
00:31:49,160 --> 00:31:50,758
You think it’ll suit the professor’s taste?

411
00:31:50,759 --> 00:31:53,480
Come on, Professor Methat can eat anything.

412
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,400
Shit.

413
00:31:56,401 --> 00:31:58,000
Did you open the cabinet door?

414
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,839
Pete did.

415
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:03,279
- Shit. We’re screwed.
- Shit.

416
00:33:12,359 --> 00:33:13,759
Shit, hurry.

417
00:33:16,359 --> 00:33:17,679
- Kao.
- P’Kao.

418
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:19,640
- Kao.
- Kao.

419
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:21,999
- Kao.
- Hey, hurry up.

420
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,519
Hey, asshole wait for me.

421
00:33:25,279 --> 00:33:26,279
Kao.

422
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:27,920
Kao.

423
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:29,240
What?

424
00:33:29,480 --> 00:33:30,200
Go, go, go.

425
00:33:30,201 --> 00:33:31,240
Shit.

426
00:33:32,759 --> 00:33:33,640
- Kao.
- Kao.

427
00:33:33,641 --> 00:33:34,798
Professor Methat is here.

428
00:33:34,799 --> 00:33:35,640
What?

429
00:33:35,641 --> 00:33:37,000
Professor Methat is at the event.

430
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:40,960
Asshole, listen first.

431
00:33:43,240 --> 00:33:44,640
Oh, Thas.

432
00:33:49,319 --> 00:33:50,559
How’ve you been, huh?

433
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:52,879
Hey, I’m good Congrats, man.

434
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:54,079
Thank you.

435
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:56,000
How about you?

436
00:33:56,319 --> 00:33:58,239
- Well... yeah.
- You’re married now.

437
00:33:58,240 --> 00:34:00,039
Here This is my girl.

438
00:34:01,319 --> 00:34:03,359
Hi, I’m Methat.

439
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:05,079
Nice to meet you.

440
00:34:05,960 --> 00:34:06,960
Uh...

441
00:34:07,359 --> 00:34:08,679
Hello.

442
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,599
Oh, Tep G.

443
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:17,159
What Tep G? This is my girl, Kao.

444
00:34:17,679 --> 00:34:20,839
Kao, this is Methat
He was my friend back in school.

445
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:22,759
He used to be
vice captain of the basketball team.

446
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:23,920
We were close.

447
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,599
Hey.

448
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:27,158
It really is Tep G.

449
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:28,239
Uh...

450
00:34:28,760 --> 00:34:30,599
You must have the wrong person.

451
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:33,158
Wait so you two know each other?

452
00:34:33,159 --> 00:34:34,519
Way more than that, man.

453
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,760
She’s the captain of my esports team.

454
00:34:39,119 --> 00:34:40,360
That explains it.

455
00:34:40,519 --> 00:34:43,480
Why Phos and Gun
were keeping me from coming to this event.

456
00:34:43,719 --> 00:34:46,238
Guess they were scared Tep G
would be embarrassed in front of me.

457
00:34:46,239 --> 00:34:48,119
All dressed in red too.

458
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:49,320
Hey, hey.

459
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:51,599
You should see Tep G when she plays.

460
00:34:52,079 --> 00:34:54,800
Everybody, get ready. We can take the base.

461
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:56,440
Get down.

462
00:34:58,039 --> 00:35:00,615
- I thought you said you were going to culinary school.
- Culinary school, my ass.

463
00:35:00,639 --> 00:35:02,559
She’s our real captain.

464
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:05,239
Eat this custard apple.

465
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:08,238
Professor, you talk too much.

466
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:09,840
Yeah, shit, you never shut up.

467
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,000
P’Pee.

468
00:35:15,719 --> 00:35:18,280
Shit. I kept this in for so long. Damn it.

469
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:22,000
P’Pee, let Kao explain first.

470
00:35:22,239 --> 00:35:23,440
It’s...

471
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:26,199
it’s not like that.

472
00:35:31,119 --> 00:35:32,320
Not like what?

473
00:35:33,559 --> 00:35:34,800
Even now,

474
00:35:35,719 --> 00:35:37,599
you still weren’t going to tell me?

475
00:35:39,159 --> 00:35:41,519
But Kao already told you.

476
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:45,119
When we played together.

477
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:46,679
And now you’re saying that?

478
00:35:47,119 --> 00:35:49,000
So I’m the only one in the wrong here, right?

479
00:35:50,719 --> 00:35:52,039
No.

480
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:56,480
That’s not what Kao meant, P’Pee.

481
00:35:56,679 --> 00:35:57,679
But.

482
00:35:58,519 --> 00:36:00,480
P’Pee hates gamers.

483
00:36:00,679 --> 00:36:02,599
How was Kao supposed to tell you?

484
00:36:04,119 --> 00:36:05,159
Do you know.

485
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:06,519
This year

486
00:36:06,719 --> 00:36:08,519
if Kao doesn’t get to compete.

487
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:12,800
Kao might never become
a pro player in this lifetime?

488
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:16,719
Even now

489
00:36:19,519 --> 00:36:21,639
you still think I’m mad because you play games?

490
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,400
I’m mad because you lied to me.

491
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:34,078
But you paid Kao
to fake a marriage too.

492
00:36:34,079 --> 00:36:35,719
Then we’re even now, right?

493
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:40,920
I’m sorry, P’Pee.

494
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:46,519
Kao knows

495
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:50,280
games caused you pain.

496
00:36:53,039 --> 00:36:54,039
But

497
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:56,639
the way Kao plays now

498
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:59,399
doesn’t mean
it’ll hurt you the way it did back then

499
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,800
I don’t want to hear it anymore.

500
00:37:04,119 --> 00:37:07,199
From now on, just do your job as my wife.

501
00:37:07,639 --> 00:37:09,159
Like we agreed
